'[Mission Dialog]'

'[info]'
Title = "Shattered Palace";
briefing = "Shattered Palace
Date: September 17, 1993 - 1045 hours
Location:  Mogadishu, Somalia

Situation:
A number of Tier One personalities will be meeting tonight at an old hotel complex in the city. Aidid is expected to be in attendance. Our teams will secure the complex and capture any Habr Gedir personnel. There will be many civilians in the area, so check your fire.  ";
briefing2 = "<cFC8932>Shattered Palace<-co>
OPORD: 6-93 TFR Date Time: 171045 September 93

1. <ucFC8932>Situation<-uco>
There's a mansion at grid reference X-Ray One where a number of Tier One personalities will be meeting tonight. Aidid is expected to be in attendance.
      <cFC8932>Weather:<-co>  Hazy, low light, hot.
      <cFC8932>Terrain:<-co>  City Center, urban.
      <cFC8932>Enemy:<-co>  30 - 40 militia with AK's, RPG's and Possible technicals.
      <cFC8932>Friendly:<-co>  None

2. <ucFC8932>Mission<-uco> 
      <cFC8932>Who:<-co> Delta Teams 4, 5, 160th SOAR, Ranger 4-2 (Transports)
      <cFC8932>What:<-co> Helo insert. 5-1 provides security. 4-1 secures Habr Gedir officials.
      <cFC8932>When:<-co> 1545 hours

3. <ucFC8932>Execution<-uco>
      <cFC8932>Commanders Intent:<-co>  Provide security for assault force, aid extraction of prisoners.
      <cFC8932>Concept of Operation:<-co>  Team Five-One will insert by Little Bird and cover Team Four's fast rope insert. Five-One will proceed to outlying building "A" and take it down to prevent reinforcements. Once clear, Five-One will clear the courtyard, regroup at the main target bldg. and provide security for extraction.

4. <ucFC8932>Service and Support<-uco>
      <cFC8932>Basic Load:<-co>  CAR15/M203, Shotgun, Claymores, Night Vision Goggles

5. <ucFC8932>Command and signal<-uco>
Task Force chain of command in effect.  Command will coordinate from base. Hand and arm signals TACSOP, with higher via FM primary and SATCOM alternate.  Standard unit CEOI";

